    "sub_name": "德文(二)",
    "sub_ename": "GERMAN(2)",
    "describe_ch": "該科目為一進階課程，以中文及德文教學，以基本之聽說讀寫為教學目標。 內容為：1、文法：受格、助動詞、分離動詞、所有格及人稱代名詞、過去式 2、主題：家庭狀況、城市生活、都市活動",
    "describe_eh": "German II is an intermediate course. It is taught in German and Mandarin Chinese. The main goal is to equip students with basic reading, writing, speaking, and writing skills. The course objects are: 1. Grammar: accusative, modal verbs, separate verbs, personal pronouns, possessive pronoun, past tense 2. Functions: family life, city life and activities.",
    "pre_subname": "GERM1001德文(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "GERM1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "GERM1001 GERMAN(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
